            "name": "title",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "WN25-DC-000410 - The Windows Server 2025 \"Deny log on through Remote Desktop Services\" user right on domain controllers must be configured to prevent unauthenticated access."
          },
          {
            "attributes": {
              "family": "windows"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "name": "platform",
                "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
                "text": "Microsoft Windows Server 2025"
              }
            ],
            "name": "affected",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5"
          },
          {
            "name": "description",
            "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5",
            "text": "Inappropriately granting user rights provides system, administrative, and other high-level capabilities.\n\n  The \"Deny log on through Remote Desktop Services\" user right defines the accounts that are prevented from logging on using Remote Desktop Services.\n\n  The Guests group must be assigned this right to prevent unauthenticated access."
          }
        ],
        "name": "metadata",
        "namespace": "http://oval.mitre.org/XMLSchema/oval-definitions-5"
      },
      "version": "1"
    }
